    "description": "This massive plantigrade animal has a barrel-shaped body, humped shoulders, and a broad round head. Thick shaggy brown-to-black fur forms a neck ruff and sometimes lightens to silver tips on its back. Its elongated muzzle has a wet black nose, small dark eyes, and short rounded ears. Powerful feet bear long nonretractile claws that plow the ground. Its tiny tail almost vanishes beneath the rump's fur.",
